   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Carbon Trust LEIA Q2-Q4 FY25-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Low Energy Inclusive Appliances (LEIA) programme is the key delivery mechanism of the Efficiency for Access Coalition, funded by Ikea Foundation and UK aid (through the TEA programme). CLASP are partners with Energy Saving Trust in delivery of the LEIA programme and provision of the co-secretariat function for the Efficiency for Access Coalition and are directly contracted to deliver the portion of the programme funded by the Ikea Foundation (subcontracting Energy Saving Trust). Energy Saving Trust are partners with CLASP in delivery of the LEIA programme and provision of the co-secretariat function for the Efficiency for Access Coalition and are directly contracted to deliver the portion of the programme funded by UK aid through the TEA programme.</narrative>
  </description>
